# ==============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify 301 Redirects & Clean URL Rewrites
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 301 永久重定向：将所有带 .html 的历史收录 URL 重定向到规范 Clean URL（自动保留 query 参数）
/article.html         /article         301!
/airport-topic.html   /airport-topic   301!
/airports.html        /airports        301!
/knowledge.html       /knowledge       301!
/tools.html           /tools           301!
/disclaimer.html      /disclaimer      301!
/trial.html           /trial           301!

# 2. 内部 200 Rewrite：若平台未自动启用 Clean URLs，则将 Clean URL 静默映射至对应 HTML 文件
/article              /article.html         200
/airport-topic        /airport-topic.html   200
/airports             /airports.html        200
/knowledge            /knowledge.html       200
/tools                /tools.html           200
/disclaimer           /disclaimer.html      200
/trial                /trial.html           200
